{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4c6d7baa36c21490fc48e1f6e69969883be150ca4426a52813fd7718a014cb1a", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま、美希！\nミルキーウェイのリーダーとして、立派だったぞ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，辛苦了，美希！\n你担任『Milky Way』的队长，表现十分称职喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
