{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0043_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "59b8e0726a170f407a091056162b00cc6c566e26f313f18db827620a1ea87549", "ja": "お腹すいたし、一緒にご飯食べにいこ！\nね、いいでしょ{$P$}♪", "zh": "刚好美希肚子饿了，一起去吃饭吧！\n好不好？应该可以吧？{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "302bfba8ff7a2e30f7625bd9f77a8b51e2fa8998c7d294b6a55e361950bd0eca", "ja": "いいけど、今日はまだライブの片付けが残ってるから、\n遅くなるだろ？　だから、日を改めて行こうな。", "zh": "可以是可以，但今天还要收拾演唱会现场，\n会弄到很晚啊。所以还是改天再去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0043_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "961a51b8e0591920b8db9bd0fdb97b6b081db72b75cd111cce697a2e7dd4411b", "ja": "むー。おあずけなんてヒドイの……。\n{$P$}、ミキをいじめて……楽しい？", "zh": "唔～居然要改天，好过分唷……\n{$P$}，这样欺负美希……很好玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
